{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u200a<i>The planets have aligned: you and the mask have found each other.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/about_banner1.png?t=1732546349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mask Around</strong> is a 2D shooter platformer roguelite where every drop of <i>juice</i> counts. This prized yellow goo will boost your moveset in... unexpected ways. Fly, jump, and punch with the gigantic hand coming out your backpack, or decide to take some risk and invest your precious juice in items and weapons. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Punch, kick and shoot increasingly creepy enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Trade juice for weapons and other powerful artefacts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Stumble upon Astralis classified secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/about_banner2.png?t=1732546349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the disorienting floors of your former employer facility, the <i>Astralis Foundation</i>, you'll stumble upon many useful trinkets... </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Masks</strong> with unique powers, that you keep across runs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Items</strong> like the Moon Boots that lets you skywalk, or the Magic Trigger that will make corpses explode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Weapons</strong>, including your classic sniper &amp; shotgun, but also some more exotic picks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Fresh drinks</strong> that will temporarily boost your stats </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Backpack</strong> skins, for fashion needs  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/rotating_mask2.gif?t=1732546349\" />\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200aSee you <strong><i>around</i></strong>!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Half Mask","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849230/561d409ab9ab4683dd4a1e62e2476146b1545e96.jpg"},{"name":"Second Half Mask","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849230/707750081b00015c8aa4564f84d693c46436ae76.jpg"},{"name":"Peace Mask","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849230/c1a6d56b9963fab46f583ef279fb03ffd7a6ffbb.jpg"},{"name":"Sugar Mask","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849230/6c155764c970e18f08c3ac872bbf9cd00284f678.jpg"},{"name":"Defense Mask","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849230/2d4142e51410cd7cd8e04baa566d0090adc8220e.jpg"},{"name":"Dirt Mask","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849230/7719fcd69d78da1dc9c6e185f8adcf077a6198a6.jpg"},{"name":"Explosion Mask","path":"h